# Rendered invitation cards: ~315 KB each, 87 of them.
#
# Deliberately not committed while the card design is still being iterated —
# git keeps every version forever, so each re-render would add another ~27 MB
# to the repository permanently.
#
# They DO have to be published for the invitations to carry them: the Apps
# Script fetches each card by URL before embedding it. So before sending,
# either drop this file and commit the set once the design is signed off, or
# host them somewhere else and point CFG.IMG_BASE at it.
*.jpg
!.gitignore
